"value":0,"status":"ok","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/ISteamUserStats/GetNumberOfCurrentPlayers/v1/?appid=5315470","error_code":null}],"events":[{"id":"steam-steam-3774220-1847286114041240","game_id":"steam-3774220","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update #5 - Simplified First Level","summary":"Hello!This small update is meant to simplify the Farmlands level while keeping it challenging enough.Removed the Equipment and Comfort needs for the Subjects, along with all the buildings and items associated with them. These will most likely be introduced as you progress further through the map.Increased the chance of encountering Potted Vikings.You now start with 10 Seeds in your inventory.Hope this makes the introduction to the game smoother!Have fun!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-25T05:17:45Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114041240","verified_at":"2026-10-25T08:09:18Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3774220-1847286114036418","game_id":"steam-3774220","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update #4 - Farms, Seeds, Pots and reworked Challenges","summary":"Hi there! A pretty substantial update this time, including some reworks, bug fixes, and new content. Here's most of the good stuff:ChallengesThe whole Quest system has been removed, and Challenges now act as the actual Quests. You unlock them just as before - by winning a level once.Challenges are now harder overall.VikingsVikings now drop considerably less loot. Most Vikings drop loot and one other item.Bolt Vikings have been renamed and reskinned as Iron Vikings to fit the new relationship bet","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-23T13:30:37Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114036418","verified_at":"2026-10-23T17:30:26Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3774220-1846651706696014","game_id":"steam-3774220","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update 3 - Major Bug Fixes","summary":"Hey guys!A couple more bug fixes, including:Fixed issues with enemy spawning on wave startRemoved lag spikes on reward displayA few more minor fixesThanks again to everyone who's been playing the demo and sharing feedback!Have fun! 🏰⚔️","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-20T16:53:04Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706696014","verified_at":"2026-10-21T02:50:37Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3774220-1846651706690251","game_id":"steam-3774220","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update - Bug Fixes, Tutorial, Extra Stats","summary":"Hey everyone!Here are a few more improvements in this update:Added a dedicated tutorial levelAdded an inspect panel that appears when clicking on SubjectsFixed several bugs, mainly related to how Subjects fetch tasksAdjusted some item values for better balanceIMPORTANT: If you have an ongoing run, playing the tutorial will require you to wipe your current level progress.Thanks to everyone who's been playing the demo and sharing feedback!Have fun!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T13:35:07Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706690251","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:52:15Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3774220-1846651706674843","game_id":"steam-3774220","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update – Bug Fixes & Balance Changes","summary":"Hey everyone!I've just updated the demo with a few improvements:Fixed several bugsAdjusted some item values for better balanceMade a few other minor improvementsRemoved one merchant shop from the mapThanks to everyone who's been playing the demo and sharing feedback! I really appreciate the support.Have fun, and let me know what you think!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-14T16:12:26Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706674843","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:52:15Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-3774220":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T10:59:47Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T10:59:46Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-3774220":"2026-10-26T10:59:47Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"3774220":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T10:59:46Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T10:59:46Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T10:59:46Z"},"5315470":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T10:59:47Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T10:59:47Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T10:59:47Z"}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-3774220","app_id":3774220,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:14:21Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"4ee6572f9dd522b87c111c2b72a5956887495a18a93e1252a5646ecef7af6e43","response_sha256":null,"source_fields":{"basic_info":{"short_description":"한 발마다 자원이 소모되고, 백성 한 명 한 명에게 저마다의 욕구가 있는 로그라이트 타워 디펜스. 생산 라인을 구축하고, 거점을 운영하고, 방어 보급을 유지하며 점점 더 거세지는 바이킹의 습격에서 살아남아라.","publishers":[{"name":"puccino"}],"developers":[{"name":"puccino"}]},"release":{"is_coming_soon":true,"custom_release_date_message":"출시 예정","coming_soon_display":"text_comingsoon"},"trailers":{"highlights":[{"trailer_name":"demo_release_trailer","trailer_url_format":"steam/apps/${FILENAME}?t=1792494571","trailer_category":